@startuml bff-session-02-вход
title Вход: три HTTP-запроса (/login → Keycloak → /signin-oidc)

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "Браузер" as B
participant "AuthenticationMiddleware" as AM
participant "TokenRefreshMiddleware" as TR
participant "AuthController" as C
participant "OpenIdConnectHandler" as O
participant "ConfigureOidcOptions\nOnTokenValidated" as E
participant "SessionCookieLifetime" as L
participant "CookieAuthenticationHandler" as CH
database "ITicketStore" as S
participant "Keycloak" as K

== Запрос 1: GET /login ==
B -> AM : GET /login?returnUrl=/
AM -> CH : AuthenticateAsync(Cookies)
CH --> AM : обычно NoResult (cookie нет, аноним)
note right of AM : если пользователь уже вошёл,\nзапрос аутентифицирован и идёт\nобычным путём (диаграммы 04, 05)
AM -> TR : next()
TR -> TR : аноним: пропуск;\nвошедший: дерево решений (диаграмма 05)
TR -> C : next()
C -> O : Challenge(OpenIdConnect,\nRedirectUri = returnUrl)
O -> O : в AuthenticationProperties:\nRedirectUri, PKCE code_verifier, correlation id
O -> O : nonce: только в nonce-cookie
O -> O : properties → state (Data Protection)
O --> B : 302 на Keycloak /auth\n+ Set-Cookie: .AspNetCore.Correlation.*,\n.AspNetCore.OpenIdConnect.Nonce.*

== Вне BFF ==
B -> K : страница входа, логин/пароль, Remember Me
K --> B : 302 /signin-oidc?code&state

== Запрос 3: GET /signin-oidc ==
B -> AM : GET /signin-oidc?code&state
AM -> O : HandleRequestAsync: путь = CallbackPath
O -> O : state → properties, проверка correlation
O -> K : POST /token (code + code_verifier + секрет)
K --> O : access, id, refresh,\nexpires_in, refresh_expires_in
O -> O : проверка id_token (nonce, подпись)
O -> E : TokenValidated(properties, TokenEndpointResponse)
E -> E : properties[bff_session_id] = новый GUID
E -> E : rememberMe = refresh_expires_in > RememberMeThreshold
E -> L : Apply(properties, rememberMe)
L -> L : IsPersistent, bff_remember_me,\nIssuedUtc = now, ExpiresUtc = now + SSO Idle режима
O -> O : SaveTokens: access, id, refresh,\ntoken_type, expires_at = now + expires_in
O -> K : userinfo → claims
O -> O : RemoteAuthenticationHandler вынимает\nRedirectUri из properties
O -> O : событие TicketReceived
O -> CH : SignInAsync(Cookies, principal, properties)
CH -> S : StoreAsync(ticket) → ключ bff-session:<guid>
CH --> B : Set-Cookie recall_bff = Protect(ключ)\nExpires только при IsPersistent
O --> B : 302 returnUrl
note over AM, TR : Запрос 3 из AuthenticationMiddleware не выходит:\nTokenRefreshMiddleware и контроллер не вызываются.

@enduml
